      "step": 1,
      "title": "初始化左右边界",
      "description": "目标值 target = 16。设左边界 left = 0，右边界 right = 6。计算中间位置 mid = (0 + 6) / 2 = 3。",
      "codeLine": "int left = 0, right = n - 1;\nint mid = (left + right) / 2;",
